    "sub_name": "校外實習導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO OFF-CAMPUS INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程由本系教師與具實務經驗業師講授，協助學生建立正確的職場實習態度，包含：職場倫理與態度、實習之權利義務說明等職前訓練。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is taught by university teachers and industrial professionals to give students knowledge of professional practice competencies, including dynamic competency, behavior competency, knowledge competency, and land ethics.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
